'''Choco''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually for 50 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}}, or by purchasing the whole bundle during the [[Easter Event 2016|2016 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.  

== Appearance ==
Its blade is made up of chocolate divided into rectangles, hence the name. The black and gold candy wrapper can be seen peeled by the heel of the blade. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*Choco is the last of the five knives included in the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Easter_Set Easter Set].
*Choco’s model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/Choco-item?id=387874991 here].
